5771-25/38984445_895648884586681_4943548350184216825_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LUE0I8GM0N8Q7kNvwGpK5HD&_nc_oc=AdqT_mOJtZTuL_385vVjI9gR4-b4EEssmapCg4hVB8j-6ktR9vu-o4wmH0T8Uz-V__c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR8poTTYMGPYa02-tU0sjhfKMZm3bWlsxiIjCzTNuRaoA&oe=6B085689"}, "display_name": "Car Parking Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Car Parking Simulator is a fully interactive, realistic and immersive car parking experience. Introducing one of the most advanced and dynamic car physics in VR.\n\nGiving players more wings of freedom by introducing a Free Roam mode in a town with a realistic traffic system, bustling with various fun activities and challenges to compete in, or just drive around and chill with any of your unlocked vehicles.\n\nFeatures:\n- All cars have realistic controls and interactive interiors with customizable right or left steering orientations.- Three main vehicle challenges, ranging from Sedan, SUV and Hatchback.\n- Formula One (F1) vehicle available as a bonus car for fun!\n- Different exhilarating environments in different parts of the day and night cycles.\n- Total 65 levels, giving you ratings based on your driving and challenge completion skills.\n- A free roam mode for players to explore using any of the unlocked vehicles or to try its own activities and challenges.", "short_description": "Car Parking Simulator is a fully interactive, realistic and immersive car parking experience. The game has one of the best vehicle physics simulations in VR."}]}, "developer_name": "Sloppy Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1D6BNfGb6atkqQcC0nfnctZJA78mcOWpeP5nuttz7Wlw/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CXW3P6emNNMZfK3T2PD8m-kpTUXwP29LklLVhr6prX8/edit?usp=sharing", "publisher_name": "Sloppy Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sloppystudio